		<item>
		<title>江淮汽车，成了资本眼中的新“太子”？</title>
		<link>https://www.tmtpost.com/8150848.html</link>
		<comments>https://www.tmtpost.com/8150848.html#comments</comments>
				<pubDate>Wed, 23 Sep 2026 18:38:14 +0800</pubDate>
						<dc:creator>超聚焦</dc:creator>
